    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Lightweight non-owning view over a contiguous sequence of elements.</para>
<para>Provides a subset of the C++20 <computeroutput>std::span</computeroutput> interface without depending on C++20. The span does not own the underlying storage; the caller is responsible for ensuring the pointed-to data remains valid for the lifetime of the span.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>T</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Element type of the sequence. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
